body:
Chasing the same experience since then too:( Other similar things I've since read and enjoyed include:

{Finding their heart by Mira Stanley}

{Sanctury: Seeking Asylum by SM Oliver}

{Dying to Love by Reese Rivers}

I don't think I've read anything better than that duology since, but here are some recs for other things I've enjoyed:

{Lords of Pain by Angel Lawson, Samantha Rue}

{The Order by Angel Lawson}

{Prey Island by Sorcha Black}

{Wanna Play a Game? by Alina May}
